			"notes": "First release. A server-side Fabric mod that adds Chunkbase-style, toggleable structure markers to [BlueMap](https://bluemap.bluecolored.de), computed directly from the world seed (no chunk scanning, so unexplored areas are covered).\n\n### Downloads — pick the jar matching your Minecraft version\n\n| Jar | Minecraft | Java | BlueMap |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `bluemap-structures-1.0.0-mc1.21.11.jar` | 1.21.11 | 21+ | 5.x |\n| `bluemap-structures-1.0.0-mc26.2.jar` | 26.2 | 25+ | 5.22+ |\n\n### Install\n\nDrop the matching jar into your server's `mods/` folder. Requires Fabric Loader + Fabric API. BlueMap is optional — without it the mod simply does nothing."
